hey're largely forgettable there's  got to be something more planned for  them there's even already some lore  associated with them apparently fighting  inside the coliseums was heralded as  some sort of holy rite of passage for  warriors to die in honorable death and  receive an urgery burial as reward for  dying honorably this practice also  apparently died out around the time that  radigan came to leadership as the second  elden lord slash queen yeah it's weird  i've already talked about it in other  videos but the point is it could  possibly enable us to not only fight  some new bosses in some really cool  circumstances but also possibly receive  some new pieces of lore regarding  everyone's favorite complicated king  figure ratigan and it could also offer  some insight into the warrior jars but  besides these things there's not much  more to be said about the coliseums  themselves so let's move on last but  most definitely not least would be the  distant past that's right you heard me  the history of the lands between listen  if they could do it for fair missoula  they could do it for sections of the  rest of the world the amount of  potential for extra backstory here is  unparalleled in fact i can't even go  over it all i probably don't even have  to allowing us to experience the story  of long ago would possibly explain more  about america or ratigan or the first  eldon lord who was apparently a dragon  before the age of the herd tree or the  great tree also before the age of the  urgery the list goes on and on and on  not to mention the possible explanation  as to what came first the elden ring or  the greater will which one was the  chicken and which one was the egg i  placed the distant pass at the end of my  list because it has the highest  potential by far for important lore  editions and it's also pretty likely  given that they would only really have  to redesign sections of the map that are  already built and build upon characters  that are already there make it happen  miyazaki but of course this is all just  my list based on what i believe is  possible mixed with what i believe would  be most enjoyable with a little bit of  geekiness dashed in there but what do  you guys think is there another area or  maybe even another character that you'd  like to see fleshed out in dlc let me  know in the comments below also thank  you so much for watching if you're still  watching please consider leaving a like  below if you enjoyed this video and  subscribe if you haven't already for  many more geeky videos to come huge  thanks as always to my banner crew of  which i have a new name to announce  please say hello to tiny elf who just  joined up you guys are all amazing and  are what keeps me going so again thank  you all so much that's about all i've  got for this one so head on over to my  socials to keep up to date besides that  i hope you all have a wonderful rest of  your day this is bandit looking forward  to seeing you next time and signing out  [Music]  you

